sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FL as Flutter
    participant H as Handler
    participant AU as AuthUsecase
    participant DS as SessionUsecase
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant RD as Redis

    FL->>H: POST /user/refresh
    activate H
    H->>AU: RefreshToken(refresh)
    activate AU
    AU->>PG: 按 sha256 查旧行 → 删除 → 重签发
    AU-->>H: 新 access + refresh_token
    deactivate AU
    H->>DS: RenewOnRefresh(同设备)
    activate DS
    DS->>RD: SET 新 session_id 续期
    deactivate DS
    H-->>FL: 200 新 token + session_id
    deactivate H

    Note over FL,RD: 一次性轮换 · 过期或账号停用直接删除并拒绝 · 其他设备 refresh 被拒
